# No legacy compatibility (pre-GA greenfield)

AIC Offline PIM has **no production customers** at `1.0.0-rc.x`. There is
no obligation to keep duplicate routes, wire fields, confirm phrases, or UI
redirects for older naming.

## The rule

> **Ship one canonical name per concept on every wire surface (HTTP JSON,
> IPC, settings import/export, OpenAPI, admin UI). Do not add "legacy
> alias", "deprecated redirect", or dual-field responses (`dek_*` beside
> `master_key_*`) for backward compatibility. Version history belongs in
> git, CHANGELOG, and regression tests — not in runtime shims.**

Concretely:

1. **One route per operation.** No parallel paths (e.g. drop
   `export-dek` when `export-master-key` exists).
2. **One JSON field per value.** Clients read `master_key_fingerprint`,
   not `dek_fingerprint` with a fallback.
3. **One confirm phrase per destructive action.** Super-admin master key
   export uses `EXPORT_MASTER_KEY` only.
4. **No bookmark redirects** unless an external standard mandates them
   (none today). Remove `/settings/crypto/dek-export` style paths.
5. **Regression testing** may assert old behavior in **tests only** (e.g.
   a test named `regression_issue_1234_pre_fix`) with a comment linking
   the commit that introduced the canonical shape. Do not expose old
   shapes in production handlers for "safety".

## Allowed exceptions

| Case | Allowed? |
| --- | --- |
| Manifest / HKLM keys frozen by `app-config.toml` (e.g. `CRYPTO_DEK_MAX_AGE_DAYS`) | yes — storage keys are not wire aliases |
| Custody profile enum strings (`software-dek`, `hsm-dek-custody`) until a manifest bump | yes — document in CHANGELOG when renamed |
| Git tags / archived migrations under `migrations/_archive/` | yes — archaeology, not runtime |
| Test fixtures that pin a **broken** old response for RCA | yes — under `tests/` only |

## Forbidden constructs

- `if phrase == NEW || phrase == LEGACY` on operator confirm phrases.
- `#[serde(alias = "dek_fingerprint")]` or duplicate struct fields for
  the same value.
- OpenAPI entries for deprecated paths that still exist in `router.rs`.
- Type aliases `FooLegacy = Foo` in shipping crates (admin-client, UI).
- Client `pickStr(wire, 'modern', 'legacy')` normalizers in production
  UI code.

